{
"file": 16,
"paths": [
"d002/f611"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "b29ee17f",
"en_raw": "At dusk, at the Tama River"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "28496ea5",
"en_raw": "a spirit appears, they say..."
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "97814580",
"en_raw": "No, it doesn't"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "37436ea7",
"en_raw": "But Segawa said"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "46b234ff",
"en_raw": "he saw it"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "b7102d3d",
"en_raw": "A woman standing barefoot"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "2bf29aea",
"en_raw": "Just a person"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "9381e40a",
"en_raw": "Yuasa and the others say"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "5c3231e5",
"en_raw": "if you see it, you get possessed..."
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "0216f99d",
"en_raw": "Then don't go"
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "9e6a73a4",
"en_raw": "Come on..."
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "306badf7",
"en_raw": "You're in a bad mood today, Sango"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "4dfa0436",
"en_raw": "Nothing"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "1a973522",
"en_raw": "Are you feeling unwell somewhere?"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "094a32d3",
"en_raw": "Die"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "fbea63eb",
"en_raw": "Let's go to the Tama, the Tama~"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "257ba3f6",
"en_raw": "A first-class river~"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "f47e1594",
"en_raw": "The Tama, the Tama~"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "7cbf9587",
"en_raw": "Geez, nobody is listening to"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "ba8ce3e5",
"en_raw": "my story..."
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "e402de5c",
"en_raw": "A dirty river, just like me..."
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "d74c0690",
"en_raw": "Nao, what do you think of this line?"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "f5d249ce",
"en_raw": "What do I think... I don't know, but"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "4ca680a1",
"en_raw": "She wasn't a ghost"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "accdb4c2",
"en_raw": "just a normal person"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "f277f39a",
"en_raw": "Sorry, but I'm not talking about"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "e4d7e3ec",
"en_raw": "ghosts or anything like that"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "b7209631",
"en_raw": "However much of a backwater Hirumi is"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "9a99869e",
"en_raw": "As for me,"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "68afbc4e",
"en_raw": "there are adults like that,"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "b4dbb159",
"en_raw": "and we just let them say"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "379bd039",
"en_raw": "those self-absorbed lines,"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "65aaf81d",
"en_raw": "is that really okay?"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "9a0b96dd",
"en_raw": "She must have had something sad happen"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "00d8a2ef",
"en_raw": "You're kind of off, you know"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "1ed360e6",
"en_raw": "Everyone has times like that"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "97c25034",
"en_raw": "What I'm saying is..."
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "477f5570",
"en_raw": "........"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "1c220cc5",
"en_raw": "Nao"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "62c43c48",
"en_raw": "aren't you angry?"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "6bf02eb5",
"en_raw": "But that way of getting angry"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "bf1da80c",
"en_raw": "feels like your usual self"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "0e3d28c4",
"en_raw": "I'm kind of relieved"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "a83dd6e7",
"en_raw": "Sango, the other day"
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "47a0abc2",
"en_raw": "you were really strange"
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "08c52452",
"en_raw": "It's not getting through at all"
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "037ef59d",
"en_raw": "...Oh well"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "6c64edf4",
"en_raw": "Next is my turn"
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "cea62b0b",
"en_raw": "I'm settling things with that woman"
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "3cc3716c",
"en_raw": "Don't get in the way, Nao"
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "012e87e8",
"en_raw": "So? Did you see? I beat her"
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "5dc9105a",
"en_raw": "The Tama River ghost"
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "13840467",
"en_raw": "'Beat her,' Sango..."
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "32c0fd9a",
"en_raw": "Sango, what a thing to say"
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "385da689",
"en_raw": "to a complete stranger"
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "c775579a",
"en_raw": "She was angry, that woman"
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "68cb24d7",
"en_raw": "that should be fine, right?"
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "ac7dc94f",
"en_raw": "She became more positive, didn't she?"
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "0caf4ba9",
"en_raw": "If she can get that angry"
},
{
"n": 59,
"h": "eba84265",
"en_raw": "there's no problem"
},
{
"n": 60,
"h": "e7dde36f",
"en_raw": "Do you really think so?"
},
{
"n": 61,
"h": "5c1f2f25",
"en_raw": "...That's how I see it"
},
{
"n": 62,
"h": "458d20db",
"en_raw": "That woman"
},
{
"n": 63,
"h": "f159f39c",
"en_raw": "isn't seen anymore"
},
{
"n": 64,
"h": "a40217cf",
"en_raw": "...The Tama River ghost, you mean?"
},
{
"n": 65,
"h": "d68e9712",
"en_raw": "In your class"
},
{
"n": 66,
"h": "a312ad8e",
"en_raw": "is she still a ghost?"
},
{
"n": 67,
"h": "8342a94e",
"en_raw": "Looks like it"
},
{
"n": 68,
"h": "fdaf9c54",
"en_raw": "I thought, saying such harsh"
},
{
"n": 69,
"h": "271b5df4",
"en_raw": "things to her, but..."
},
{
"n": 70,
"h": "9fcd7ac0",
"en_raw": "maybe it was better after all"
},
{
"n": 71,
"h": "0c07c9b5",
"en_raw": "Well, that's about it"
},
{
"n": 72,
"h": "296307c5",
"en_raw": "Instead of thinking 'how unhappy am I'"
},
{
"n": 73,
"h": "b94260f0",
"en_raw": "and things like that"
},
{
"n": 74,
"h": "1f188e4f",
"en_raw": "moving is far more positive"
},
{
"n": 75,
"h": "4e8520ca",
"en_raw": "For that ghost lady too"
},
{
"n": 76,
"h": "35d0e5ca",
"en_raw": "this was for the best"
},
{
"n": 77,
"h": "68b1b7c2",
"en_raw": "Yeah, because her mother went home"
},
{
"n": 78,
"h": "e7fed205",
"en_raw": "she's not there anymore"
},
{
"n": 79,
"h": "167598c9",
"en_raw": "The little siblings"
},
{
"n": 80,
"h": "d93f79d5",
"en_raw": "...Hmm"
},
{
"n": 81,
"h": "97474661",
"en_raw": "Good for you too, Shiina"
},
{
"n": 82,
"h": "1e28064a",
"en_raw": "Solved the rumor of the Riverbank Ghost!"
},
{
"n": 83,
"h": "458d20db",
"en_raw": "That woman"
},
{
"n": 84,
"h": "f159f39c",
"en_raw": "isn't seen anymore"
},
{
"n": 85,
"h": "a40217cf",
"en_raw": "...The Tama River ghost, you mean?"
},
{
"n": 86,
"h": "045549d9",
"en_raw": "In your class,"
},
{
"n": 87,
"h": "a312ad8e",
"en_raw": "is she still a ghost?"
},
{
"n": 88,
"h": "8342a94e",
"en_raw": "Looks like it"
},
{
"n": 89,
"h": "a748e77a",
"en_raw": "But even if she's a normal person"
},
{
"n": 90,
"h": "fc19fc5f",
"en_raw": "she really was"
},
{
"n": 91,
"h": "f43ff44c",
"en_raw": "a bit weird, right?"
},
{
"n": 92,
"h": "f32d0d57",
"en_raw": "A bit?"
},
{
"n": 93,
"h": "4a847c80",
"en_raw": "...That's plenty weird"
},
{
"n": 94,
"h": "f9ef4fce",
"en_raw": "If it's just neurosis or something"
},
{
"n": 95,
"h": "afffa02e",
"en_raw": "I think, but"
},
{
"n": 96,
"h": "33ddc5f6",
"en_raw": "Listen, you're wrong"
},
{
"n": 97,
"h": "62451c07",
"en_raw": "Kurumi saw it"
},
{
"n": 98,
"h": "0fd2b8e6",
"en_raw": "...There were two"
},
{
"n": 99,
"h": "1357df29",
"en_raw": "...Little siblings"
},
{
"n": 100,
"h": "75c3fba4",
"en_raw": "And they said"
},
{
"n": 101,
"h": "8ba927fb",
"en_raw": "that their mother comes"
},
{
"n": 102,
"h": "448dad25",
"en_raw": "to see them every day"
},
{
"n": 103,
"h": "b446d26e",
"en_raw": "Then where did that woman"
},
{
"n": 104,
"h": "f7c8988d",
"en_raw": "go...?"
},
{
"n": 105,
"h": "acda04b4",
"en_raw": "You see, the little siblings"
},
{
"n": 106,
"h": "1da0f6f6",
"en_raw": "came to Kurumi's house"
},
{
"n": 107,
"h": "625633a5",
"en_raw": "Anyway"
},
{
"n": 108,
"h": "450cd7e8",
"en_raw": "She doesn't come to the Tama anymore, right?"
},
{
"n": 109,
"h": "dd44254e",
"en_raw": "Then that's fine"
},
{
"n": 110,
"h": "af914936",
"en_raw": "The rumor is solved"
},
{
"n": 111,
"h": "4f950be8",
"en_raw": "Solved the rumor of the Riverbank Ghost...?"
},
{
"n": 112,
"h": "a9056ace",
"en_raw": "'Adult circumstances' and whatnot"
},
{
"n": 113,
"h": "b1dfc8cd",
"en_raw": "if you ask kids"
},
{
"n": 114,
"h": "075533be",
"en_raw": "I think they're just excuses"
},
{
"n": 115,
"h": "7956e101",
"en_raw": "These days"
},
{
"n": 116,
"h": "b15a9846",
"en_raw": "playing the tragic heroine"
},
{
"n": 117,
"h": "75349244",
"en_raw": "nobody stops to say"
},
{
"n": 118,
"h": "a3c45190",
"en_raw": "kind words to you"
},
{
"n": 119,
"h": "48dbdb6d",
"en_raw": "...Ah, anyway"
},
{
"n": 120,
"h": "3d2ad57b",
"en_raw": "I wonder if Mom"
},
{
"n": 121,
"h": "fe635dc4",
"en_raw": "will be home early today..."
},
{
"n": 122,
"h": "45398462",
"en_raw": "Why was that woman"
},
{
"n": 123,
"h": "c5c583ce",
"en_raw": "standing in a place like that"
},
{
"n": 124,
"h": "6046dff8",
"en_raw": "we'll never know now, but"
},
{
"n": 125,
"h": "57f90ebd",
"en_raw": "there are all kinds of"
},
{
"n": 126,
"h": "00e64905",
"en_raw": "people with circumstances in this world..."
},
{
"n": 127,
"h": "14f5784c",
"en_raw": "Enough, drop it"
},
{
"n": 128,
"h": "da16b673",
"en_raw": "Let's talk about something else already!"
}
]
}